/** @page amqprelnotesguide Release Notes

    @tableofcontents

    - documentation uses the public native API declarations and preserves language
      indexes when adding cross-references to the helper modules

    - fixed custom TLS CA trust, client certificate/key handling and verification policy;
      certificate files are checked against the caller's sandbox before use

    @section amqp_v1_0 amqp Module Version 1.0
    - initial release
    - @ref Qore::Amqp::AmqpConnection "AmqpConnection" class for AMQP 1.0 messaging
    - @ref Qore::Amqp::AmqpMessage "AmqpMessage" class with full type mapping and delivery tag support
    - TLS/SSL and SASL authentication with URL credential extraction
    - Delivery disposition: accept, reject, release, modify
    - Durable subscriptions with close/unsubscribe lifecycle
    - JMS-style message selectors via @ref Qore::Amqp::AmqpFilterOptions "AmqpFilterOptions"
    - Transacted message delivery: begin/commit/rollback with TransactionalState on TRANSFER frames
    - AMQP Management Protocol for broker introspection (addresses, queues)
    - Batch send via \c sendBatch() for efficient bulk publishing
    - Shared subscriptions via source capabilities (\c shared, \c global)
    - Connection statistics: message/byte counts, link count, uptime
    - Graceful link close: \c closeSender(), \c closeReceiver()
    - Connection lifecycle events: connected, disconnected, error, reconnected
    - Automatic link recovery on reconnection (\c setAutoRecoverLinks())
    - @ref Amqp::AmqpClient "AmqpClient" high-level API with cached sender/receiver links
    - @ref Amqp::AmqpProducer "AmqpProducer" and @ref Amqp::AmqpConsumer "AmqpConsumer" for dedicated messaging
    - @ref Amqp::AmqpRequestReply "AmqpRequestReply" for request-reply pattern with auto-correlation
    - @ref Amqp::AmqpManagementClient "AmqpManagementClient" for broker introspection
    - @ref Amqp::AmqpConnectionObservable "AmqpConnectionObservable" for connection event Observer pattern
    - @ref Amqp::AmqpMessageConverter "AmqpMessageConverter" for auto-encode/decode (JSON, YAML, XML)
    - Dead letter queue routing via @ref Amqp::AmqpConsumer::rejectToDlq() "rejectToDlq()"
    - @ref amqpdataproviderintro "AmqpDataProvider" module with factory, connection schemes, and observable events
*/
